### Requests for the JetBrains HTTP client (click the ▶ next to each one).
### Mock login: Bearer jan (trusted), eva (verified), petr (registered).
### Seed ids: set UkLWZ (children gbHJd, EfhxL), Obsah kruhu VqXmZ, Pythagorova věta uw2YK,
### Eva's private OIJLh, textbook problem AXs1i; chapter Rovnice UkLWZ; licence CC BY 4.0 gbHJd.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### My problems (dashboard)
GET {{base}}/problems?scope=mine
Authorization: Bearer jan

### Public browser, filtered by chapter (includes child chapters)
GET {{base}}/problems?scope=public&chapterId=UkLWZ
Authorization: Bearer eva

### Detail of a set
GET {{base}}/problems/UkLWZ
Authorization: Bearer jan

### Create a set
POST {{base}}/problems
Authorization: Bearer jan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Řešte rovnice",
  "assignment": "Vyřešte rovnice v oboru reálných čísel:",
  "result": null,
  "tagIds": ["UkLWZ"],
  "chapterIds": ["UkLWZ"],
  "children": [
    { "name": "Rovnice a)", "assignment": "\\( 2x + 3 = 11 \\)", "result": "\\( x = 4 \\)" },
    { "name": "Rovnice b)", "assignment": "\\( x^2 = 9 \\)" }
  ]
}

### Edit the whole set: keep a), drop b), add c), copy Obsah kruhu in
PATCH {{base}}/problems/UkLWZ
Authorization: Bearer jan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lockVersion": 3,
  "children": [
    { "id": "gbHJd" },
    { "name": "Rovnice c)", "assignment": "\\( 3x - 1 = 2x + 4 \\)" },
    { "copyFromId": "VqXmZ" }
  ]
}

### Copy a published problem
POST {{base}}/problems/VqXmZ/copy
Authorization: Bearer eva

### Publish the set with a licence
POST {{base}}/problems/UkLWZ/publish
Authorization: Bearer jan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "licenseId": "gbHJd" }

### Dissolve a set (children become standalone)
POST {{base}}/problems/UkLWZ/dissolve
Authorization: Bearer jan

### Pickers
GET {{base}}/tags?q=rov
Authorization: Bearer jan

###
GET {{base}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer jan

###
GET {{base}}/licenses
Authorization: Bearer jan
